    "balance": "Prefer original live demos, code, or a narrated walkthrough over announcements. Match type and feature, not follower count. Include at least two independent creators/publishers when possible.",
    "attribution": "Credit the original maker and link the original artifact. Keep a curator post only as discovery context. Deduplicate the same work across X, Instagram, LinkedIn, and YouTube.",
    "technicalClaims": "Check current tool behavior against its own documentation. An influencer recommendation is not capability evidence.",
    "commercial": "Keep sponsorship or creator-owned-product claims distinguishable from independent examples; do not automatically reject useful public demos."
  },
  "platformAccess": {
    "YouTube": "Use verified creator channels and public video pages. Record original publication date and useful timestamps. Use accessible captions/transcripts only; never invent the contents of an unseen video. Do not download videos.",
    "Instagram": "Use accessible original public Reels or carousels. If blocked, use a creator-owned article, YouTube walkthrough, or user-supplied link. No login automation or private feed coverage.",
    "X": "Use accessible original posts or approved APIs. Do not assume a recent-only search endpoint covers the full 90-day window.",
    "LinkedIn": "Use accessible original public posts. Search snippets can discover a post but do not establish full content, date, or media. No private feed coverage."
